OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo hits UK with wind and
OL,4,Arain as warnings issued for large parts
OL,5,Aof country
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing more wet and
OL,8,Fwindy weather to large parts of the UK
OL,9,F- a day after Storm Austen hit the
OL,10,Fcountry
OL,12,FA yellow warning for rain began at
OL,13,F11:00 in large parts of England and
OL,14,FWales, while a yellow wind warning
OL,15,Fstarted in Northern Ireland at 10:00
OL,17,FAmber warnings for wind in northern
OL,18,FEngland, Scotland, and parts of
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland begin at 21:00
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
