OL,6,
OL,7,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,8,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,9,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,10,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,12,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,13,Fpower in south-west England on Friday -
OL,14,Fthousands are still waiting to be
OL,15,Freconnected on Saturday
